{
 "priority": 2,
 "source_bins": [
  "sound_auth.bin",
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Well, that's strange.": "",
  "I find that very strange.": "",
  "You stated earlier that you hadn't seen\nany footage from the camera near the sauna.": "",
  "You stated earlier that you hadn't seen any footage\nfrom the camera near the sauna.": "",
  "But then, how would you be able to\nre-enact things exactly as they went down?": "",
  "But if you hadn't seen it, how would you be able to\nre-enact the fight exactly as it appeared?": "",
  "You also claimed you did not inspect the area yourself.\nBut it seems that wasn't the truth...": "",
  "Also, I believe you claimed you did not inspect the area yourself.\nBut it seems that too was a lie.": "",
  "Why are you hiding the truth\nfrom us, Prosecutor?": "",
  "Why are you hiding the truth from us?": "",
  "I wasn't hiding anything...!": "",
  "As you can see, the original footage\nisn't exactly clear.": "",
  "I think it would be fair to say...\nthe original footage isn't exactly clear.": "",
  "I would understand if you had denied that the\ndefendant was the man who punched our witness.": "",
  "I would understand if you had denied that\nthe defendant was the man who punched our witness.": "",
  "But instead, you claimed you hadn't\nseen the footage at all.": "",
  "If I had to guess, when you first saw that footage...": "",
  "...you realized you couldn't rule out the possibility\nthat Hamura-san here was the other man.": "",
  "If I had to guess, when you first saw the footage,\nyou realized Hamura might've been the other man.": "",
  "At the very least, you couldn't rule out\nthe possibility. So, you lied, I would say.": "",
  "At the very least, you couldn't rule out the possibility.\nSo, you obscured the evidence.": "",
  "That's not true!": "",
  "No! I didn't!": "",
  "Can we be sure that what\nyou say is credible?": "",
  "Are you above your own \"credibility\"?": "",
  "You've already lied outright\nin a court of law.": "",
  "And unfortunately for you, there's only one\nperson who thinks the defendant is guilty.": "",
  "Unfortunately for you, there is only one man in this court\nwho still believes the defendant is guilty...": "",
  "And that's you, Prosecutor.": "",
  "And that's the manipulator\nstanding before me.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Oh look, a cat.)</color>": "",
  "Three bodies have turned up in Kamurocho,\neach of them missing both eyes.": "",
  "Every one a Kyorei man.\nKume's the most recent.": "",
  "Every one a Kyorei Clan man.\nKume's the most recent.": "",
  "And the guy who killed 'em all\nwas your \"Mole,\" huh?": "",
  "And the guy who killed 'em—\nthat was your \"Mole,\" huh?": "",
  "Yup. Got Kume hand-delivered\nto him by Hamura.": "",
  "Yup. Captain Hamura did the handoff,\nand Kume was the mark.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(In other words, Hamura was cooperating with the Mole.\nHe might've even been involved in all three cases.)</color>": "",
  "But Hamura kept that hidden,\nand ended up getting off scot-free.": "",
  "But he didn't admit to anything,\nso he got off scot-free.": "",
  "In turn making us look like fools.": "",
  "Making us look like fools.": "",
  "I'm not about to let him\nget away with this.": "",
  "Agreed. We've gotta go all\nout if we wanna win.": "",
  "Agreed. We've gotta go all out\nif we wanna win.": "",
  "Too bad the pay sucks.": "",
  "Would be nice to get paid, though.": "",
  "Don't hate, man.": "",
  "I don't get it. Why would the captain\nwanna protect the Mole anyways?": "",
  "I don't get it. Why would the captain\nprotect the Mole anyways?": "",
  "He could've gotten life in the slammer\nif things went south.": "",
  "Hard to say with what we know now. First things first,\nwe need to figure out who the Mole is.": "",
  "Who knows? We don't have all the pieces yet.\nFirst, we need to figure out who the Mole is.": "",
  "That's why we're here, remember?": "",
  "The Mole's first victim was found\nright in this very alley.": "",
  "It's where they found the Mole's first victim.\nRight in this very alley.": "",
  "Mhm. Happened back in August.": "",
  "Yeah. This first one\nwas back in August.": "",
  "Kenkichi Mashiba. A Kyorei guy, 27.\nPretty small time. Even lower rank than Kume.": "",
  "Small-time Kyorei guy. Kenkichi Mashiba, age 27.\nEven lower rank than Kume.": "",
  "Body got reported in the morning,\neyes gouged clean outta his skull.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(So the corpse was found\npretty much the same way as Kume.)": "",
  "Where exactly did they find him?\nWhat sort of position was he in?": "",
  "Is there anything on Mashiba's location,\nhow he was positioned...?": "",
  "Not sure. Cops don't really\npublish those kindsa details.": "",
  "Nope. They don't really\npublish those details.": "",
  "Well, guess we'll have\nto do one better, then.": "",
  "Shame.\nNot a lot we can do here.": "",
  "Hold up a sec. The cops already did their whole\nsong and dance searchin' for the Mole.": "",
  "Look. The cops did their own investigation\nfor the Mole.": "",
  "But they couldn't turn up a damn thing.": "",
  "Why do you think we can do any better?": "",
  "Why do you think we'd do any better?": "",
  "Don't worry, we got this.": "",
  "Don't worry.\nWe've got this.": "",
  "Oh, it's that easy huh?": "",
  "How the heck are you\nso confident, man?": "",
  "If anyone's gonna know\nabout the Mole, it's Hamura.": "",
  "If anyone's gonna know about the Mole,\nit's Hamura.": "",
  "And who has better access to him\nthan anyone else? We do. Right?": "",
  "We've got an inside track.\nOne that the police could never have used.": "",
  "...Guess you got a point.": "",
  "...Yeah, guess so.": "",
  "We'll need to get our hands on\nsome more info first, though.": "",
  "Still, we'll have to dig up some more\ninformation first.": "",
  "The quickest way to find the truth\nis through good old fashioned legwork.": "",
  "That's what detectives do. The fastest way\nto the truth is through good old-fashioned legwork.": "",
  "Heh, I can do old fashioned.": "",
  "Heh, yeah. I get it.": "",
  "Doesn't matter whether or not we \"can\"\ndo better. We have to.": "",
  "It's not about whether we \"can\" do better.\nWe <font_kind=yakuza_italic>have</font_kind> to.": "",
  "Hamura made us look like fools,\nand I'm not about to stand for that.": "",
  "I've got a reputation to think of.": "",
  "Look, I'm doing this whether you like it or not.\nIf you're gonna complain, do it somewhere else.": "",
  "Look, I'm doing this whether you like it or not.\nYou gonna complain, or you gonna help?": "",
  "Well, aren't you just a\nconfident sonuvabitch.": "",
  "Whoa. Tone it down, badass.": "",
  "You really think we can do this, huh?": "",
  "Maybe. If we stay positive.": "",
  "Maybe, if we stay positive.": "",
  "Anyways, the next victim was in,\nuh... October.": "",
  "Anyways, the second victim after that\nwas in, uh... October.": "",
  "Found in an alley off Tenkaichi Street.": "",
  "Looks like... he was found in\nan alley off Tenkaichi.": "",
  "Shall we head over?": "",
  "Wanna check it out?": "",
  "I'm actually gonna head over\nalone if you don't mind.": "",
  "Actually, I think I'm gonna\nhead over alone.": "",
  "Think you can get in touch with\nthat informant in the meantime?": "",
  "In the meantime, you want to try\ngetting in touch with that informant?": "",
  "Huh? Why Ayabe?": "",
  "What, you mean Ayabe?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If we're going to use Kaito's connections to a dirty cop,\nnow's the time.)</color>": "",
  "Didn't you say something about\nhim selling police info?": "",
  "Didn't you say something about him\nselling police info?": "",
  "If he's got info on the Mole,\nwe need it.": "",
  "We need to know about\ntheir hunt for the Mole.": "",
  "Yup, I can ask.": "",
  "Got it. I can try asking.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Tenkaichi Alley...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is where the Mole's\nsecond victim was found.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If I recall, the body was found\nin the garbage dump. So, around here?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This investigation is my top priority right now.\nTenkaichi Alley should be a good place to start.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(That alleyway is pretty narrow.\nNo chance a car could fit through.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(The victim must have walked here on his own.\nOr did the Mole bring him here after killing him?)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(There isn't enough evidence here\nto say either way.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I think this goes out to\nTaihei Boulevard.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(If they know their way through all these back alleys,\nthe Mole must be pretty familiar with Kamurocho.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(It's a dumpster.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I'd think that if the body had been found in here,\nI would have heard about it by now.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Probably safe to say\nit wasn't in the trash.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This is where they take out the garbage, right?\nThe corpse must have been lying around here.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(This case happened months ago, though.\nDon't suppose there are any traces of the body left...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I should take a little closer look.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hm? Whoa, this is...!)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Gah, this is totally unrelated\nto the case...)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Guess there are no more signs of the murder.\nDoesn't seem like there's anything left to find.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Too much time has passed since all these cases.\nIt's gonna be pretty tough to search for the Mole now.)</color>": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(I bet the Mole is a Kamurocho expert.\nSomeone who can just blend into the crowd...)</color>": "",
  "(There's really not much I can do without the police reports.\nI guess coming here was a waste of time...)": "",
  "(Phew, I'm exhausted.)": "",
  "(Maybe I should go check in on Genda-sensei.\nIt's been a while since I've heard from him.)": "",
  "(Helping that homeless guy is more important right now.\nI have to go look for Moroboshi-sensei in the sewers.)": "",
  "Well, look what the cat dragged in.": "",
  "Well, look who finally\ndecided to show up.": "",
  "Afternoon. Did I keep you\nwaiting or something?": "",
  "Hey. I didn't realize\nit had been that long.": "",
  "Nah, we were just talking\nabout you, actually.": "",
  "I'm sure. As it happens,\nwe were just talking about you.": "",
  "Do you have a minute, Yagami-san?": "",
  "'Course. Especially if you've\ngot a job for me.": "",
  "Of course. Especially if you have\na job for me.": "",
  "You're always so eager to work.\nA great fighter, too.": "",
  "You're so devoted to your work.\nA great fighter, too.": "",
  "You ever take lessons?": "",
  "Did you study martial arts?": "",
  "I did back when I was a kid, yeah.\nThe rest has been more of a learn-by-doing thing.": "",
  "Yeah, I took some lessons when I was a kid.\nBeyond that, it's mostly self-taught.": "",
  "I like to think of it as...\nKamurocho style.": "",
  "If I had to give it a name, I guess it'd be...\nKamurocho style?": "",
  "Because you trained yourself\non the streets?": "",
  "Because the streets of Kamurocho\ntaught you everything, right?": "",
  "Man, what a life!\nI bet you've got some crazy stories.": "",
  "Man, that's so cool!\nYour life is like a movie!": "",
  "Hey, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hi there, Yagami-san.": "",
  "Hey, is Shintani-sensei in?": "",
  "Hey. Shintani-sensei still not in?": "",
  "Not yet, sorry.": "",
  "Not yet. Sorry.": "",
  "Um... Yagami-san.": "",
  "Um... Yagami-san?": "",
  "Actually, I do have some work for you.": "",
  "Just so you know,\nI found some work for you.": "",
  "Yeah? What kind?": "",
  "Great. What's the job?": "",
  "Here, take a look at what I've got.": "",
  "Well... This is what I have\nright now.": "",
  "I'll send the details to your office.\nPut them up on your board or something.": "",
  "I'll arrange for the client\nto meet you at your office.": "",
  "Sounds good.\nThanks, Saori-san.": "",
  "Sounds good.\nI appreciate it, Saori-san.": "",
  "Yagami. You still sniffing\naround that Kume case?": "",
  "So. You still sniffing around that case?\nEven after the acquittal?": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Oh yeah. Never told Genda-sensei\nI'm still looking for the Mole.)</color>": "",
  "Yeah. That's not a problem, is it?": "",
  "Yeah. Is that a problem?": "",
  "Not a \"problem\" per se, but the case is closed.\nI can't keep paying you to investigate.": "",
  "Fine by me.\nIt's a personal matter now.": "",
  "Even so. You're convinced Hamura's\ncovering for the killer, right?": "",
  "Even so. You're convinced Hamura's covering\nfor the killer, right?": "",
  "You know he'll be none too happy\nif he finds out you're still on the case.": "",
  "If he finds out you're still on the trail...\nHamura's not going to be happy.": "",
  "He brought this on himself\nif you ask me.": "",
  "It's only fair after the way\nhe treated me.": "",
  "Speaking of, have you seen him\nsince the trial?": "",
  "No, but he and Shintani keep in touch.\nThey're practically drinking buddies these days.": "",
  "No, but he and Shintani keep in touch.\nSounds like they're pretty good drinking buddies.": "",
  "...Huh.": "",
  "Come on in, Hattori-san.\nIt's small, but it's home.": "",
  "Oh, I know all about this place.": "",
  "Oh, I know all about this place\nalready.": "",
  "Right, Yagami-san?": "",
  "Oh, sorry. I forgot.\nShintani had an interview today.": "",
  "Oh, sorry.\nI forgot Shintani had an interview today.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Shintani and Hattori.\nTwo of my favorite people in the world.)</color>": "",
  "Just pretend Yagami isn't here, yeah?": "",
  "How about... we just pretend\nYagami isn't here?": "",
  "Wouldn't want your readers thinking he had\na hand in getting Hamura's acquittal.": "",
  "I wouldn't want your readers thinking\nhe was the one behind our acquittal.": "",
  "Oh don't worry about that, Shintani-sensei.\nThat courtroom was yours, and yours alone.": "",
  "I should go.\nLooks like I'm the third wheel here.": "",
  "...I should go.\nLooks like I'd just be in the way.": "",
  "Without a photo, Yagami-san?\nFor as much as you did on the case?": "",
  "After all you did for the case, Yagami-san,\nyou can at least stick around for a photo.": "",
  "Lemme just get one of you\nand Shintani-sensei!": "",
  "How about a shot of you\nand Shintani-sensei?": "",
  "Tea, sir?": "",
  "Have some tea.": "",
  "What a treat. That would be great,\nShirosaki-sensei.": "",
  "What a treat...\nMuch appreciated, Shirosaki-sensei.": "",
  "(What was <font_kind=yakuza_italic>he</font_kind> doing there...?)": "",
  "(Anyway, I need to meet with that client.\nBack to the ol' office...)": "",
  "(Still haven't heard back from Kaito-san.\nGuess I'll see if there's anything going on outside.)": "",
  "Whoa!": "",
  "(Still nothing from Kaito-san...\nWhat now?)": "",
  "(What was that!?)": "",
  "(It was heading toward the Millennium Tower.\nI better see what that's all about.)": "",
  "Yo, it's Kaito. Ayabe's ready for us.\nSays he might have some info on the Mole.": "",
  "Nice work, Kaito-san.": "",
  "<color=ｍonologue>(Hopefully the police report will give us a lead...)</color>": "",
  "Heh. We're meeting at that indoor fishing pond.\nKoi Bride or some shit. You heard of it? ": "",
  "Heh. We're meeting at the indoor fishing pond.\nKoi Bride or some shit. You heard of it? ": "",
  "Indoor fishing pond?\nCan't say I have.": "",
  "It's an indoor pond?\nCan't say I have.": "",
  "Neither had I.\n'til about 10 minutes ago.": "",
  "Neither had I,\n'til about ten minutes ago.": "",
  "Anyway, it's over on Shichifuku Street.\nI'll meet you there.": "",
  "(...Koi Bride.\nGuess this is the place.)": "",
  "Yooo. Welcome.": "",
  "Welcome... or whatever.": "",
  "Yo, pull up a chair, Tak.": "",
  "Yo. Over here, Tak.": "",
  "Ayabe said he'd meet us here, but...": "",
  "I talked to Ayabe.\nHe said he'd meet us here.": "",
  "Dunno what his deal is.\nThis is pretty outta the way.": "",
  "Still, somethin' feels weird.\nThis ain't how it usually goes down.": "",
  "Maybe he's just trying to play it safe\nsince we're new clients.": "",
  "Could be keeping a low profile\nuntil he can trust us.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "That's not true!": "ไม่จริงซะหน่อย!",
  "...Yeah, guess so.": "...ครับ ก็คงงั้น",
  "Well, look what the cat dragged in.": "โอ๊ะโอ๊ะ ใครมาเนี่ย",
  "Not yet, sorry.": "ยังเลย ขอโทษที",
  "...Huh.": "...เอ๊ะ",
  "Whoa!": "เฮ้ย!"
 }
}
